	'nl_p1' => 'To subscribe, enter your corporate email address in the registration field or send an email directly to desk@meguri-waste.example. Ines Lindqvist will add your site contacts to the dispatch bulletin distribution list. We respect your attention: Collection Notes contains strictly logistical information regarding your collection window, rota adjustments, and waste regulations. You can update site contact details or unsubscribe at any time with a simple email request.',
