	'pv_p1' => 'Clients may review, update, or request the deletion of their personal and contact information by contacting our customer desk. Inquiries can be submitted by email to desk@meguri-waste.example or by written correspondence to Meguri Waste, Unit 4, Quay Road Yard, Port Alder. Statutory waste transfer documentation, weighbridge records, and carrier compliance files under licence WC-2011-0418 are maintained in accordance with mandatory regulatory retention periods. For any questions regarding data protection, our team is available Monday to Friday from 08:00 to 17:30.',
